id": "1579497603473899", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628882_1579497606807232_8336888543596356713_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7BKrAvqtWN4Q7kNvwHpULWf&_nc_oc=AdpQ533_KInWopeXuHQfh5M78LTlPYdf3YNBFphe9uWx8DksZx8_ROe3DpxuG6Qwa2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRXGezATy8qbqjtye4DvWfv7cJ6VKYmfhjktKtOSKSKnQ&oe=6B0C5111"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u672a\u6807\u9898-1.png", "id": "29257445000526428", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/788764420_29257445043859757_8925783767562944254_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=915K7i-TaYYQ7kNvwHgm3iK&_nc_oc=AdoHtwJ6yLj87t7ix7i7vM-Q6Idvpj1Ydhrxmvq3Fww4G-Ikv31ts0X_LfQrNEYIICM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRVPeJ987ZYQIl5Qp-_kkLV6G32Pe0Ne5aim-2BKAl_zg&oe=6B0C69D0"}, "display_name": "ArtSudoku", "keywords": [], "long_description": "ArtSudoku brings the timeless appeal of Sudoku to VR in a whole new way!\nEvery Sudoku puzzle hides a famous masterpiece. As you solve the puzzle step by step, the artwork is gradually revealed piece by piece. Enjoy the satisfaction of solving Sudoku while watching iconic works of art come to life before your eyes.\nThe game offers multiple ways to play. Take on a Level Mode with increasingly challenging puzzles and time-based excitement, or enjoy a more relaxed Sandbox Mode, where you can customize the experience and play at your own pace.\nOnce a masterpiece has been unlocked, it will be added to your Gallery, where you can return and admire it anytime.\nSolve the numbers. Reveal the art. Step into a unique VR journey where Sudoku meets timeless masterpieces!", "short_description": "ArtSudoku brings the timeless appeal of Sudoku to VR in a whole new way!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://davidyan0o0.github.io/ShaderGame/